OL,3,GNEWSABudget 2026: 'Surrey is a lovely
OL,4,Aplace - but it can be stressful'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurrey is one of the wealthiest parts
OL,7,Fof the country and, according to
OL,8,Fcouncil papers, one of the largest net
OL,9,Fcontributors to the UK economy after
OL,10,FLondon.
OL,12,FBut with average house prices at around
OL,13,F#500,000 as well as high rents, it is
OL,14,Falso one of the most expensive places
OL,15,Fto live.
OL,17,FFor many people in the county, there
OL,18,Fare huge cost-of-living pressures that
OL,19,Fare a struggle to deal with.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
